        "created_at": "2014-12-23T17:49:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The original wording of Ambuscade's Personal Cloaking Device could lead to a corner case in which the card would flip Ambuscade to his front side and leave him stuck on his non-invisible side, even though the cloaking device was in play. Therefore, the game text of that card has been changed to read:</p><blockquote><p>When this card enters play, flip Ambuscade's villain character cards to his “Invisible Stalker” side.</p></blockquote><p>Here is what that card should look like:</p><p>![|400x560](upload://axWgUlgh8qoYAgja1d5VQv05Lm8.jpeg)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-13T15:41:54.236Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
